---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="소개 | The Greenhouse" description="Bunnykey의 블로그와 연락처를 소개합니다." canonicalPath="/gardener/">
  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>소개</h1>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>안녕하세요. Bunnykey입니다.</p>
      <p>이 블로그에는 생활과 기술, 음악처럼 관심 있는 것들을 기록합니다.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="about-links" aria-label="연락처">
      <a href="https://github.com/bunnykey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      <a href="mailto:sapphire7558@gmail.com">이메일</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="about-note">이곳의 글은 개인적인 생각이며, 소속 조직의 견해를 대변하지 않습니다.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  .about-page { width: min(100% - 2.75rem, 48rem); margin: 0 auto; padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 2rem; font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .about-copy { max-width: 38rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.9; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .about-copy p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .about-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .about-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .25em; font-size: .9rem; }
  .about-note { max-width: 38rem; margin-top: 3rem; color: var(--color-foreground-muted); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.8; word-break: keep-all; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .about-page { padding-top: 2.2rem; } }
</style>
